WEBVTT

00:08:27.979 --> 00:08:32.282
"Well, the core of our religion
is here to stay with us.

00:08:32.306 --> 00:08:34.376
It's our faith,
and we will be loyal to it.

00:08:34.400 --> 00:08:36.376
But we can change how it was interpreted,

00:08:36.400 --> 00:08:38.664
because it was interpreted
according to the time

00:08:38.688 --> 00:08:40.122
and milieu in the Middle Ages.

00:08:40.146 --> 00:08:42.003
Now we're living in a different world,

00:08:42.027 --> 00:08:44.227
with different values
and political systems."

00:08:44.251 --> 00:08:46.679
That interpretation
is quite possible and feasible.

00:08:47.198 --> 00:08:50.705
Now, if I were the only person
thinking that way,

00:08:50.729 --> 00:08:51.997
we would be in trouble.

00:08:53.066 --> 00:08:54.944
But that's not the case at all.

00:08:55.627 --> 00:08:58.534
Actually, from the 19th century on,

00:08:58.558 --> 00:09:04.516
there's a whole revisionist, reformist --
whatever you call it -- tradition,